  profileId: motivation.profile.navigation.mid
  profileLabel: Navigation Mid Motivation
  survivalNeed: This area helps the player not get lost when runs grow longer and
    messier.
  survivalNeedWeight: 1
  resourceNeed: Its value is mostly navigational clarity with a little practical
    reward.
  resourceNeedWeight: 0.6
  engineeringNeed: It supports route planning, beacon logic, and better return discipline.
  engineeringNeedWeight: 0.95
  curiosityPull: Branching space should invite comparison and mental mapping.
  curiosityPullWeight: 1.2
  storyPull: Landmarks and route breaks can quietly suggest other systems nearby.
  storyPullWeight: 0.85
  rareValuePull: Rare value is weak; the real payoff is mastery of movement and memory.
  rareValuePullWeight: 0.55
  optionalityRule: These pulls are invitations, not requirements; the player decides
    which one matters today.
  returnRule: The area should stay worth revisiting later with a different goal,
    toolset, or tolerance for risk.
  ownershipRule: The player should feel they built their own reasons to come back
    here.
